        "text": "Which claim matches each kind of measurement to the correct conversion relation?",
        "marks": 1,
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "Temperature uses $F=\\frac{9}{5}C+32$, so $25^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}=77^{\\circ}\\mathrm{F}$; length uses $1\\,\\mathrm{m}=100\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, so $4\\,\\mathrm{m}=400\\,\\mathrm{cm}$."
